abstract: "Official implementation of the Fluidic Energy Pressure System (FEPS), introducing a pre-recombination relativistic fluid boost (+9.15% energy density, N_ur = 3.52377) derived from Stored Angular Momentum (SAMs) to resolve H_0 (73.04 km/s/Mpc) and S_8 (0.7918) tensions simultaneously, paired with a deterministic 476 kHz Verilog silicon matrix control architecture."
